  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - TPO 474/2023 - T2 Horse Chestnut\r\n\r\nThe current map attached appears to suggest that the tree's location is to the rear of 172/176 Sutherland Grove, rather than at the application address.\r\n\r\nReference is made to a 2025 inspection indicating a change in lean. However, no evidence of this inspection or any associated report has been provided. When visiting Tree Officers did not note any visible signs of movement around the base of T2 (TPO 474/2023 T2).\r\nAn unbalanced crown would not, in itself, justify the removal of the tree. If this is a significant concern, a reduction in crown size should be considered.\r\nThe presence of internal decay within a fallen tree does not demonstrate that the remaining standing tree has decay. Such an assumption is not reasonable without supporting evidence, and no evidence to substantiate this claim has been provided.\r\n"
  ]
